{"synopsis":"[Dari Studio yang mengerjakan <Academy’s Genius Swordmaster dan The Nebula’s Civilization>\n\nKarena garis keturunanku, aku tidak pernah bisa naik status dan akhirnya mati sebagai tentara bayaran biasa. Namun, saat aku membuka mata lagi, mereka mengatakan bahwa aku adalah putra seorang Archduke.\n\nSekarang aku akhirnya memiliki keluarga, status, dan bahkan bakat—hal-hal yang dulu hanya bisa kuimpikan—hanya ada satu hal yang tersisa untuk dilakukan... mendaki ke puncak.\n\nKehidupan bangsawan yang luar biasa dari mantan kapten tentara bayaran yang kini menjadi putra ketiga adipati agung dimulai sekarang.]","alternative_title":"환생했더니 대공의 셋째 아들","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c45b61a0-dd7e-4098-9a0c-fd7ba1f4bd84","number":"43","chapter":"43","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b64399da-6465-4d03-bd23-decbfcb28407","number":"42","chapter":"42","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2026-07-25","released":"2026-07-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"55cdb307-7534-4c0e-a93a-7adef266ebe3","number":"41","chapter":"41","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ddd7ed2f-9ca6-4ec1-846f-5c9f697343e7","number":"40","chapter":"40","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-07-10","released":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"38e48139-085d-46c9-ac00-88acbc6c1c8a","number":"39","chapter":"39","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2026-07-04","released":"2026-07-04","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"737fdf28-276a-4017-84c7-e10c6985a1c8","number":"38","chapter":"38","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ea909b14-904a-4a85-ab26-b5391786ecca","number":"37","chapter":"37","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2026-06-20","released":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"3d7c0723-50b5-4952-9061-e0ad2587f21a","number":"36","chapter":"36","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2026-06-13","released":"2026-06-13","images":[]},{"c